[gd_scene format=3]

; The Locks, east of the Quay: a lock chamber of the sea-wall, its basin frozen but for a pool of open brine in its floor (swum
; across, or jumped). A shrine, a Chorister asleep by the east wall. East at floor level, the Chantry. High in the east wall, the
; way on to the Hold: the wall is iron, climbed with Mag-grip; coming back from the Hold is a drop off its top.

[ext_resource type="Material" path="res://assets/materials/wet_stone.tres" id="1_wet_stone"]
[ext_resource type="PackedScene" path="res://scenes/kit/Block.tscn" id="2_block"]
